      "title": "Slice 2: object cards for the ICM system map's 11 noun types",
      "source_type": "github_pr",
      "url": "https://github.com/brandondees/code-quality-atlas/pull/237",
      "excerpt": "## Summary\n\nSlice 2 of the ICM system map's human-gated audit pipeline (Slice 0+1 —\ninventory + catalog — shipped in #236): one card per closed node type in\n`docs/map/_meta/schema.md`.\n\n### Added\n\n- `docs/map/objects/generation-pipeline/{manifest,lens,category,collapsed-entrypoint}.md`\n- `docs/map/objects/eval-hardening/eval-scenario.md`\n- `docs/map/objects/decisions-and-tracking/{decision,gap,plan-doc}.md`\n- `docs/map/objects/{command,runbook,hook}.md` — flat cards for the three\n  types `objects/CONTEXT.md` already flagged as not having a dedicated\n  cluster yet\n\nEvery card cites source directly (`skills/manifest.yaml`,\n`docs/research/cluster-*.md`, `docs/open-questions.md`, `docs/map-gaps.md`,\n`docs/plans/`, `commands/`, `docs/runbooks/`, `hooks/hooks.json`) and is\ndated/commit-pinned per `objects/CONTEXT.md`'s \"verified\" status rule — no\ncard restates a current-state count (per this repo's standing drift-prone-\nfacts rule).\n\n### Also fixed, adjacent to this slice\n\n- `_meta/schema.md`'s Naming rule for `Decision` only named the `QN` form\n  (a header under \"Open questions\"). Real `Decision` instances also exist\n  as `DN` bullets under \"Decisions made\" — a different marker, same closed\n  type. Fixed so the rule is re-derivable from source alone, as the rule\n  itself requires.\n- `objects/_index.md`'s status column and Card links updated from `stub` to\n  `verified` for all 11 types.\n- `docs/map/CLAUDE.md` (+ `AGENTS.md`/`routing.md` twins) now routes to\n  `objects/<cluster>/` since it exists; `processes/*.md` and\n  `effects/CONTEXT.md` stay out of scope until their own later slices.\n\n### Not in this PR (deliberately)\n\nSlice 3 (process cards) and Slice 4 (the effects/change-impact index)\nremain separate, human-gated next steps — stopping here for review before\ncontinuing, per this map's own audit-pipeline discipline.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python -m pytest`: 403 passed\n- `python -m tooling.cli drift`: clean\n- `ruff check .`: clean\n- `markdownlint-cli2 docs/map/**`: clean\n- Every new card's YAML frontmatter parsed and type-checked (all string\n  fields, no unquoted-placeholder YAML gotcha)\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01TSuF44qHo35brGecv5jT9b)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added documentation cards for 11 map object types, including commands, decisions, plans, lenses, hooks, and runbooks.\n  * Added an index linking each verified object type to its dedicated documentation.\n  * Added routing for direct noun/object lookups.\n  * Expanded decision documentation to support both settled decisions and open questions.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Clarified object relationships, metadata, validation, generation behavior, and change impact.\n  * Documented that process and effects documentation is not yet available.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
